{"title":"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems\">2000 AMC 12 #2</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems\">2000 AMC 10 #2</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Power_Solve)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Power Solve)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Daily_Dose_of_Math)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Daily Dose of Math)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/7/5473a29e8dff16c430a01c0f1ec3c087e20f838e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2000(2000^{2000}) =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"132\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/6/f56a924f128bda1d9010579012a49f72ebbff4d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)} \\ 2000^{2001}  \\qquad \\textbf{(B)} \\ 4000^{2000}  \\qquad \\textbf{(C)} \\ 2000^{4000}  \\qquad \\textbf{(D)} \\ 4,000,000^{2000}  \\qquad \\textbf{(E)} \\ 2000^{4,000,000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"691\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Recall that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/a/8ca279c756193ae05379fda53d87c8491cc6cc9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{b}\\cdot a^{c} = a^{b+c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"104\" height=\"17\" /> for any positive real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/acc6d9a6172d35127b6cb37ea92192caf7029a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>By rules of exponents, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/5/455e8420e4c9bf607ddad7a91c11692e6a8bbca7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2000\\left(2000^{2000}\\right) = \\left(2000^{1}\\right)\\left(2000^{2000}\\right) = 2000^{2000+1} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } 2000^{2001}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"528\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>Solution edited by armang32324, integralarefun, j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/a/1bad47f78cbb5da520da25deafcda90c9f7a9f4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2000^2000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"17\" /> is the result of multiplying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/f/05f1ffc8a6829f25b0b0366087a70dfd4e06fef6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> copies of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/f/05f1ffc8a6829f25b0b0366087a70dfd4e06fef6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> together, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/1/ec18e460d5dfaf8b01368a82a4daf0ffd70fd3f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2000\\left(2000^{2000}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"121\" height=\"23\" /> must be the result of multiplying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/8/408b278c9af8b6bf752dfb5e72974628db7f3bd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2000 + 1 = 2001$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"15\" /> copies of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/f/05f1ffc8a6829f25b0b0366087a70dfd4e06fef6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> together, which results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/4/704f384f5a1b14f7293b3c919649cc34f56a9dc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } 2000^{2001}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"112\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>- itsj, edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Power_Solve.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Power_Solve)\">Video Solution (Power Solve)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Power Solve)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/YrAs8vadKMk?si=QQg5xvRfvKra54bE&amp;t=124\">https://youtu.be/YrAs8vadKMk?si=QQg5xvRfvKra54bE&amp;t=124</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Daily_Dose_of_Math.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Daily_Dose_of_Math)\">Video Solution (Daily Dose of Math)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Daily Dose of Math)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h0QtF9J0oPs\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h0QtF9J0oPs</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12\" title=\"2000 AMC 12\">2000 AMC 12</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Answer_Key\" title=\"2000 AMC 1